  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Ethyl benzoate on reaction with 2 moles of grignard reagent forms a tertiary alcohol.Hence acetophenone cannot be formed in this reaction as shown below.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ph</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>COO</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>MgBr</mi><mo>&#10230;</mo><msub><mi>PhCOCH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>MgBr</mi></mrow></mover><mi>PhC</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>OH</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
